	(gr_text "DESIGN NOTES\n========================================\n\nOutline 88x38mm R4.5mm; M3 corner holes Ø3.4mm\nUSB 3.0 opening 12.5x12.9mm; STATUS hole Ø2.0mm to view the D3 LED (body-center\n aligned via fit-check).\nShield: F+B copper pour, 0.3/0.6mm via stitch - perimeter ring + a ring around\n the USB opening. Ø7mm exposed-copper mask at each M3 (screw grounds shield to\n enclosure).\n Pour/via/mask/cutout-ring script-generated (scripts/stitch_perimeter.py)"
		(at 15 35 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000088")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "FABRICATION SPECIFICATION\n========================================\nProject: TAPRX-888 Rear End Plate\n\nGENERAL\n  Layers:             2\n  Material:           FR4, standard Tg\n  Finished Thickness: 1.6mm (~63 mil) +/-10%\n  Surface Finish:     ENIG\n  Solder Mask:        Blue, both sides\n  Silkscreen:         White, both sides\n  IPC Class:          2\n\nSTACKUP\n  F.Cu     1 oz  (0.035mm)\n  core     1.51mm  FR4 (Er 4.5)\n  B.Cu     1 oz  (0.035mm)\n  (1.6mm nominal, ENIG)\n\nCONTROLLED IMPEDANCE\n  None -- non-signal shield plate.\n\nMINIMUM FEATURES  (JLCPCB 2-layer, standard)\n  Track width:    0.15mm\n  Track spacing:  0.15mm\n  Via:            0.60mm dia / 0.30mm drill  (GND stitch ring)\n  Annular ring:   0.15mm\n  Hole-to-hole:   0.50mm (diff net) / 0.25mm (same net)\n  Min PTH drill:  0.30mm\n  Copper-to-edge: 0.50mm\n  Silk:           0.15mm min width, 2.0mm min text height/width\n\nVIAS\n  Through-hole only -- no blind/buried vias.\n  Via tenting: both sides (stitch vias covered by mask).\n\nNOTES\n  1. All dimensions in mm unless noted.\n  2. Non-signal shield end plate -- no assembly / BOM / CPL.\n  3. Mounting / LED / USB holes are routed Edge.Cuts cutouts (not drilled)."
		(at 15 150 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "f0b07132-e36f-45db-9acf-6d773cee9d78")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
	)
